Published source data in the examples
-------------------------------------

Six built-in examples embed parts of published papers' source data, each under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Only the columns the rebuilt figures need are kept, some drawn-only values rounded; each data
file names what was kept. Copyright of each dataset remains with its authors.

- Stucchi et al., Nature Immunology (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41590-026-02643-y
  (packages/ui/src/paperExample.ts)
- Johnston et al., Nature Immunology 27, 1874–1886 (2026),
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41590-026-02613-4 (packages/ui/src/johnstonData.ts)
- Hoffmann et al., Nature Chemistry (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41557-026-02240-4
  (packages/ui/src/examples/published/hoffmannData.ts)
- Tawk et al., Nature Microbiology (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41564-026-02500-6
  (packages/ui/src/examples/published/tawkData.ts)
- Chen et al., Nature Immunology 27, 1643–1652 (2026), https://doi.org/10.1038/s41590-026-02547-x
  (packages/ui/src/examples/published/chenData.ts)
- Swaminathan et al., Nature Immunology 27, 1619–1632 (2026),
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41590-026-02568-6 (packages/ui/src/examples/published/swamData.ts)

Other published papers rebuilt in development builds read their source data from a local folder
at run time; none of their data is part of this repository.


