apps/e2e/fixtures/xy-with-exclusions.pzfx, are example .pzfx files from the R package pzfx 0.3.1
by Yue Jiang (https://github.com/Yue-Jiang/pzfx). Copyright (c) 2018 Yue Jiang. MIT License (full
text in packages/io/test/fixtures/pzfx/README.md). Changed only to leave out the name of the
program that made them (see that README).

The NIST StRD reference datasets and certified values (packages/stats/test/fixtures/nist/,
fetched by tools/nist/fetch.mjs) are works of the U.S. Government (National Institute of
Standards and Technology).
